# Build context for the Bot Desktop image.
#
# The Dockerfile COPYs four files. Everything else here is documentation and
# Kubernetes manifests that have no business inside a container that a browser
# driven by an LLM can read.
*

!Dockerfile
!entrypoint.sh
!sidecar/requirements.txt
!sidecar/server.py
!sidecar/browser.py

**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
